      "writtenOn": "2025-09-22T14:38:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "if the platform does not implement system suspend, then it will never save/restore GIC context. But if some platforms do implement system suspend, then I think all of them will need to save GIC context in the same way. Can it be an optional platform independent feature then?",
