      "writtenOn": "2025-09-22T15:08:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Different platform might have different context sizes, depending on the implemented PPI/SPI count so this has to be platform specific.\nAlso there are cases when a platform save all redistributors.\nThis all depends on platform capabilities and the implemented power states. I think we should keep all these differences in the `PsciPlatformInterface` implementations.",
